  });

  it('通知去抖拍不打断重试链：重试挂起期间 notifyRefresh() → 重试按原退避点补发（去抖拍前作废旧重试）', async () => {
    vi.useFakeTimers();
    const roundCalls = scriptDetailRounds([
      okRound(fakeDetail([])),
      rejectRound('首败'),
      okRound(detailWithRuns()),
    ]);
